<title>USA: Demeter eliminates $1.5 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Demeter eliminates $1.5 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, N.C. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Demeter BioTechnologies Ltd said on Monday that its largest noteholders and a number of creditors have converted all their debt to equity.</p>
<p>The company said that would eliminate nearly $1.5 million of accumulated debt.</p>
<p>	  -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
